// SQLite corruption hardening (2026-07-29) -- live WAL-mode SQLite databases
// and their sidecar/conflict files must never be synced bidirectionally.
// Root cause of localized data/walkforward.db corruption. Do not remove
// without first addressing why these were excluded.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.sync-conflict-*.db
*.sync-conflict-*.db-wal
*.sync-conflict-*.db-shm

// High-churn, fully regenerable logs -- not needed for cross-device sync,
// and were themselves generating sync-conflict files.
logs/
